@StackedHub.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5032

### Public menu
GET {{StackedHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/menu

### Login (demo customer)
POST {{StackedHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "priya.nair@example.co.za",
  "password": "Stacked123!"
}

### Forgot password
POST {{StackedHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "priya.nair@example.co.za"
}

### AI recommendations (Gemini with grounded fallback)
POST {{StackedHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ai/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "something spicy under R150"
}
